---
import { createWhatsAppUrl } from '../../utils/whatsapp';
import ScrollIndicator from '../ui/ScrollIndicator.astro';

const whatsappUrl = createWhatsAppUrl(
  "5544991416128",
  "Olá, Mateus! Vim pelo site da Made In Polar e gostaria de solicitar um orçamento."
);
---

<section id="contato" class="deck-slide w-full px-4 sm:px-6 py-3 sm:py-4 justify-between">
  <div class="hidden sm:block" aria-hidden="true"></div>

  <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto w-full my-auto space-y-4 sm:space-y-5">
    <div class="text-center space-y-1">
      <span class="text-[11px] sm:text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-vivid">
        Tire suas dúvidas
      </span>
      <h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-extrabold text-white">
        Perguntas Frequentes
      </h2>
    </div>

    {/* Acordeão Compacto */}
    <div class="space-y-2">
      <details class="group rounded-2xl bg-navy/60 border border-white/10 px-4 sm:px-5 py-2.5 sm:py-3 transition open:border-vivid/40">
        <summary class="flex cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between font-bold text-white text-xs sm:text-sm">
          <span>Faz sujeira na parede ou molha o chão?</span>
          <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-vivid transition-transform group-open:rotate-180 shrink-0 ml-2" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"/></svg>
        </summary>
        <p class="mt-2 text-[11px] sm:text-xs text-slate-300 border-t border-white/10 pt-2 leading-relaxed">
          Não. Usamos uma lona coletora impermeável vedada em volta do aparelho. Toda a água suja desce direto para um galão fechado.
        </p>
      </details>

      <details class="group rounded-2xl bg-navy/60 border border-white/10 px-4 sm:px-5 py-2.5 sm:py-3 transition open:border-vivid/40">
        <summary class="flex cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between font-bold text-white text-xs sm:text-sm">
          <span>Precisa retirar o ar-condicionado da parede?</span>
          <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-vivid transition-transform group-open:rotate-180 shrink-0 ml-2" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"/></svg>
        </summary>
        <p class="mt-2 text-[11px] sm:text-xs text-slate-300 border-t border-white/10 pt-2 leading-relaxed">
          Não precisa desinstalar. Toda a higienização é feita no próprio local, preservando o gás original e a instalação.
        </p>
      </details>

      <details class="group rounded-2xl bg-navy/60 border border-white/10 px-4 sm:px-5 py-2.5 sm:py-3 transition open:border-vivid/40">
        <summary class="flex cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between font-bold text-white text-xs sm:text-sm">
          <span>Atendem empresas e emitem Nota Fiscal?</span>
          <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-vivid transition-transform group-open:rotate-180 shrink-0 ml-2" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"/></svg>
        </summary>
        <p class="mt-2 text-[11px] sm:text-xs text-slate-300 border-t border-white/10 pt-2 leading-relaxed">
          Sim! Atendemos residências, consultórios, clínicas e empresas em Paranavaí com emissão de Nota Fiscal (MEI).
        </p>
      </details>
    </div>

    {/* CTA Final */}
    <div class="text-center pt-1">
      <a
        href={whatsappUrl}
        target="_blank"
        rel="noopener noreferrer"
        class="px-6 sm:px-8 py-3 sm:py-3.5 rounded-full bg-vivid hover:bg-blue text-white font-bold text-xs sm:text-base transition-all shadow-[0_0_30px_-5px_rgba(0,153,255,0.5)] inline-flex items-center gap-2 active:scale-95"
      >
        <span>Falar no WhatsApp: (44) 99141-6128</span>
        <svg class="w-4 h-4" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2"><path d="M5 12h14M12 5l7 7-7 7"/></svg>
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>

  <ScrollIndicator targetId="#inicio" label="Voltar ao início" />

  {/* Rodapé com respiro inferior no telemóvel (pb-14) para não colidir com o botão flutuante */}
  <footer class="w-full max-w-6xl mx-auto pt-3 pb-14 sm:pb-2 border-t border-white/10 flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-between gap-2 text-[11px] text-slate-400">
    <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
      <span class="font-extrabold text-white">MADE IN <span class="text-vivid">POLAR</span></span>
      <span>•</span>
      <span>Mateus Alves</span>
    </div>
    <div class="flex items-center gap-4">
      <a href="https://instagram.com/madepolar" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="hover:text-vivid transition">@madepolar</a>
      <span>Paranavaí - PR e Região</span>
    </div>
  </footer>
  
</section>

{/* Botão Flutuante dimensionado para Mobile e Desktop */}
<a
  href={whatsappUrl}
  target="_blank"
  rel="noopener noreferrer"
  aria-label="Falar com a Made In Polar pelo WhatsApp"
  class="fixed bottom-4 right-4 sm:bottom-5 sm:right-5 z-50 w-12 h-12 sm:w-14 sm:h-14 rounded-full bg-whatsapp hover:bg-whatsapp-hover text-white flex items-center justify-center shadow-[0_8px_25px_rgba(37,211,102,0.45)] transition-transform hover:scale-105 active:scale-95"
>
  <svg class="w-6 h-6 sm:w-7 sm:h-7 fill-current" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
    <path d="M12.031 6.172c-3.181 0-5.767 2.586-5.768 5.766-.001 1.298.38 2.27 1.019 3.287l-.582 2.128 2.182-.573c.978.58 1.911.928 3.145.929 3.178 0 5.767-2.587 5.768-5.766.001-3.187-2.575-5.77-5.764-5.771zm3.392 8.244c-.144.405-.837.774-1.17.824-.299.045-.677.063-1.092-.069-.252-.08-.575-.187-.988-.365-1.739-.751-2.874-2.502-2.961-2.617-.087-.116-.708-.94-.708-1.793s.448-1.273.607-1.446c.159-.173.346-.217.462-.217l.332.006c.106.005.249-.04.39.298.144.347.491 1.2.534 1.287.043.087.072.188.014.304-.058.116-.087.188-.173.289l-.26.304c-.087.086-.177.18-.076.354.101.174.449.741.964 1.201.662.591 1.221.774 1.394.86.174.086.275.072.376-.044.101-.116.433-.506.549-.68.116-.173.231-.145.39-.086s1.011.477 1.184.564.289.13.332.202c.045.072.045.419-.1.824zm-3.423-14.416c-6.627 0-12 5.373-12 12 0 2.159.57 4.184 1.564 5.938l-1.572 5.748 5.899-1.549c1.691.921 3.63 1.443 5.69 1.443 6.627 0 12-5.373 12-12 0-6.628-5.373-12-12-12z"/>
  </svg>
</a>